{
    "title": "Bazaart AI Photo Editor Design",
    "description": "Bazaart is an easy-to-use AI-powered photo editor and design studio. With Bazaart, you can create stunning designs and effortlessly edit photos, from removing backgrounds and objects to enhancing images with AI tools. No design experience required - get your design superpowers today!\r\n\r\n<b>Get Creative</b>  \ud83d\udcab\r\nFrom online selling to digital marketing to social media posting, Bazaart is here to help. Create product photos (white background an option), profile pics, stories, posts, logos, flyers, posters, cards, collages, invitations, memes, stickers, ai art and works of art.\r\n\r\n<b>Powerful photo editing and design tools</b> \ud83e\uddf0\r\n\u2022 Instantly remove the background from any photo\r\n\u2022 Remove objects and people from any photo\r\n\u2022 Place products and people in stunning AI-generated backgrounds using the Magic Background tool\r\n\u2022 Turn your text into fantastic images using the AI Photo tool\r\n\u2022 Replace anything in a photo with a simple text prompt using the Magic Edit tool\r\n\u2022 Turn blurry photos into HD, boost resolution and quality with the enhance tool\r\n\u2022 Cut out photos like a pro with the crop and eraser tools\r\n\u2022 Create your own WhatsApp stickers\r\n\u2022 Enhance, adjust, and customize photos: change exposure, contrast, saturation, vibrance, warmth, tint, shadows, highlights, and blur\r\n\u2022 Add up to 30 photo layers: each layer is independently editable and all changes reversible\r\n\u2022 Apply fabulous filters on photos to add a \u201cwow\u201d effect\r\n\u2022 Create custom edge styles for photos with the outline and shadow tools\r\n\u2022 Combine photos with mind-blowing blending effects\r\n\u2022 Edit and modify text with alignment\r\n\u2022 Perfectly align photos, text, and any element with auto-snapping\r\n\r\n<b>Beautiful content you\u2019ll love</b> \ud83e\udd70\r\n\u2022 Choose from thousands of amazing backgrounds, stickers and shapes\r\n\u2022 Add stunning photo overlays\r\n\u2022 Browse through a great collection of fonts or add your own \r\n\u2022 Use photos from your gallery, Google Photos, Google Drive, Dropbox, and more\r\n\r\n<b>When you\u2019re ready</b> \u2728\r\n\u2022 Save as an image with an opaque (JPG) or transparent background (PNG)\r\n\u2022 Share your creations on social media or send as text or email\r\n\r\n<b>Upgrade to Bazaart Premium</b> \ud83c\udf52\r\nCreate professional looking designs in seconds with Premium!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Remove people and objects from your photos\r\n\u2022 Create without limits with a huge collection of templates, graphics and fonts\r\n\u2022 Get full access to all advanced tools and VIP support\r\n\r\nYour Bazaart Premium subscription will automatically renew at the end of each term and your credit card will be charged through your Google Play account unless you unsubscribe. Refunds will not be provided for any unused portion of the term.\r\n\r\nNeed help? Please email us at support@bazaart.com and we will get back to you quickly!\r\n\r\nBAZAART\u00ae is a registered trademark of Bazaart Ltd.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bazaart is an easy-to-use AI-powered photo editor and design studio. With Bazaart, you can create stunning designs and effortlessly edit photos, from removing backgrounds and objects to enhancing images with AI tools. No design experience required - get your design superpowers today!<br><br><b>Get Creative</b>  \ud83d\udcab<br>From online selling to digital marketing to social media posting, Bazaart is here to help. Create product photos (white background an option), profile pics, stories, posts, logos, flyers, posters, cards, collages, invitations, memes, stickers, ai art and works of art.<br><br><b>Powerful photo editing and design tools</b> \ud83e\uddf0<br>\u2022 Instantly remove the background from any photo<br>\u2022 Remove objects and people from any photo<br>\u2022 Place products and people in stunning AI-generated backgrounds using the Magic Background tool<br>\u2022 Turn your text into fantastic images using the AI Photo tool<br>\u2022 Replace anything in a photo with a simple text prompt using the Magic Edit tool<br>\u2022 Turn blurry photos into HD, boost resolution and quality with the enhance tool<br>\u2022 Cut out photos like a pro with the crop and eraser tools<br>\u2022 Create your own WhatsApp stickers<br>\u2022 Enhance, adjust, and customize photos: change exposure, contrast, saturation, vibrance, warmth, tint, shadows, highlights, and blur<br>\u2022 Add up to 30 photo layers: each layer is independently editable and all changes reversible<br>\u2022 Apply fabulous filters on photos to add a \u201cwow\u201d effect<br>\u2022 Create custom edge styles for photos with the outline and shadow tools<br>\u2022 Combine photos with mind-blowing blending effects<br>\u2022 Edit and modify text with alignment<br>\u2022 Perfectly align photos, text, and any element with auto-snapping<br><br><b>Beautiful content you\u2019ll love</b> \ud83e\udd70<br>\u2022 Choose from thousands of amazing backgrounds, stickers and shapes<br>\u2022 Add stunning photo overlays<br>\u2022 Browse through a great collection of fonts or add your own <br>\u2022 Use photos from your gallery, Google Photos, Google Drive, Dropbox, and more<br><br><b>When you\u2019re ready</b> \u2728<br>\u2022 Save as an image with an opaque (JPG) or transparent background (PNG)<br>\u2022 Share your creations on social media or send as text or email<br><br><b>Upgrade to Bazaart Premium</b> \ud83c\udf52<br>Create professional looking designs in seconds with Premium!<br><br>\u2022 Remove people and objects from your photos<br>\u2022 Create without limits with a huge collection of templates, graphics and fonts<br>\u2022 Get full access to all advanced tools and VIP support<br><br>Your Bazaart Premium subscription will automatically renew at the end of each term and your credit card will be charged through your Google Play account unless you unsubscribe. Refunds will not be provided for any unused portion of the term.<br><br>Need help? Please email us at support@bazaart.com and we will get back to you quickly!<br><br>BAZAART\u00ae is a registered trademark of Bazaart Ltd.",
